auditcore_extrapolation 0.1.0 — attribution and authorization

New implementation in auditcore. No code was copied from other repositories.
The formulas and printed tables (z values, reliability factors) follow the
European Commission guidance "Guidance on sampling methods for audit
authorities" (EGESIF_16-0014-01, 20/01/2017) and the RER calculation template
CPRE_23-0013-01 Annex 3; both documents are cited by name and section only,
no text of them is included. The reliability factors of Appendix 3 are
factual table values and are verified against the exact Poisson limits.

On 2026-09-22 the rights holder decided: "die Bibliotheken sollen MIT sein,
die anderen Repos nicht; die Bibliotheken kommen nach auditcore".
Status: USER_AUTHORIZED_MIT for this library.

The library computes; it does not decide. Conclusions ("material",
"inconclusive") restate the decision rules of the guidance and do not replace
the professional judgement of the audit authority.
